OL,3,GNEWSAThe fans at the FA Cup game no-one
OL,4,Acould see
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor many football fans, an FA Cup win
OL,7,Fis the stuff of dreams. But for 690
OL,8,FNotts County supporters, thick fog
OL,9,Fmeant they could barely see it happen.
OL,11,FIan Kirke was among the Magpies fans
OL,12,Fwhose view of Saturday's FA Cup
OL,13,Ffirst-round tie against Altrincham was
OL,14,Fobscured by fog, leaving many unable to
OL,15,Fsee the League One side's penalty
OL,16,Fshootout victory.
OL,18,FThe thick layer of fog provided chaos
OL,19,Fnot just for the players and fans, but
OL,20,Falso commentators and camera operators
OL,21,Fat the J Davidson Stadium.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
