OL,3,GNEWSAThe fans at the FA Cup game no-one
OL,4,Acould see
OL,5,
OL,6,FKirke said fans had to rely on the
OL,7,Fcheers - or silence - from the home
OL,8,Fsupport during the shootout. "It's the
OL,9,Fmost bonkers festival of football I've
OL,10,Fever seen in my life," he added.
